cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the PWG German–Russian translation-memory pack, please cite it."
title: "PWG TM canonical v1: German–Russian translation memory (JSONL, TMX 1.4b, TEI Lex-0, OntoLex)"
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  2,392 publication-grade PWG (Böhtlingk–Roth) German→Russian translation-memory
  records in one canonical JSONL and three derived interchange formats (TMX 1.4b,
  TEI Lex-0, OntoLex-Lemon/vartrans/PROV-O), with a zero-loss scholarly-field ledger.
